<http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Recommended practice is to identify the resource by means of a string conforming to an identification system. Examples include International Standard Book Number (ISBN), Digital Object Identifier (DOI), and Uniform Resource Name (URN).  Persistent identifiers should be provided as HTTP URIs."@en <https://data.gov.dk/dataset/dictionary/common-semantic-dictionary/7e52c88b-65f9-4dd2-b1fe-3fb383f0d5a8> .
